            "output": "<task id=\"ses_ef8ca7e3fffe1JUTVhvHJPzxdE\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n- **[P1] `src/app/api/verify/resend/route.ts:43-51`**: Expired links cannot be resent. The UI offers “Send a replacement link” for `expired`, but the API only updates rows with `verificationExpiresAt > now`, then returns a generic success without sending mail. Permit eligible expired pending requests and refresh the expiry, or remove the expired resend path.\n\n- **[P3] `src/components/verification-form.tsx:22-91`**: Duplicated Code. Turnstile loading/rendering/reset logic duplicates `src/components/signup-form.tsx:22-105`. Extract the shared integration so script lifecycle and callback behavior do not drift between signup and resend flows.\n</task_result>\n</task>",
